[PrintTextModified Text:（是什么时候……）|#0204Bad02_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:水声使我一惊，回头一看，<br>那里站着一名少女。|#0204Bad02_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且是素未谋面的少女。|#0204Bad02_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你是……|#0204Bad02_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一开口，那少女就像一团烟雾一般消失了。<br>|#0204Bad02_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么回事……？）|#0204Bad02_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:完全搞不懂。|#0204Bad02_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:总之，最好先把这里有个陌生少女的事<br>告诉其他人。|#0204Bad02_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我正要转身去追蕾雅，就在此时。<br>|#0204Bad02_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

