[PrintTextModified Text:有什么东西扯住了我的脚，我无法浮出水面。|#0204Bad02_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（到底怎么回事……！）|#0204Bad02_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我慌乱地环顾昏暗的水下，<br>刚才那少女正抓住我的脚微笑着。|#0204Bad02_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:终于……终于抓到下一个了。|#0204Bad02_Girl001| AuthorId:Girl RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（下一个……？）|#0204Bad02_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我还在思考她那欣喜的语气是什么意思时，<br>身体已不断被拖往水深处。|#0204Bad02_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（要窒息了……这么下去我会……！）|#0204Bad02_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我向着逐渐远去的水面伸出手，<br>却怎么也够不着。|#0204Bad02_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_3 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（啊啊……这样下去，会死……）|#0204Bad02_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，没关系的……就这样放松身体，交给我吧。|#0204Bad02_Girl002| AuthorId:Girl RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的嗓音温柔，如同安抚幼儿一般，<br>引导我走向这次生命的终点。|#0204Bad02_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

