[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0204Bad02_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0204Bad02_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

