[PrintTextModified Text:我猛地回头看向声音响起的方向，<br>只见那里站着一名少女。|#0204Bad02_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就是在湖边见到的，那个少女。<br>把我拖入湖底的，那个少女。|#0204Bad02_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……为什么你会在这。|#0204Bad02_Hiro030| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想着在我消失之前，<br>先告诉你一声。|#0204Bad02_Girl004| AuthorId:Girl RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:消失……？|#0204Bad02_Hiro031| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对茫然的我，<br>她露出了无比愉悦的笑容。|#0204Bad02_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你已经死在那个湖里了。<br>作为替代我的祭品。|#0204Bad02_Girl005| AuthorId:Girl RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多亏你，<br>我终于可以从这里解脱了。|#0204Bad02_Girl006| AuthorId:Girl RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Fearful1

