[PrintTextModified Text:接下来轮到你了。<br>直到献上下一个祭品前，<br>你会永～远被囚禁在这座监牢里哦。|#0204Bad02_Girl007| AuthorId:Girl RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女说完，<br>身影便渐渐淡去。|#0204Bad02_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

