[PrintTextModified Text:没事。<br>反正你的时间多得是呢。名副其实，多得要死。|#0204Bad02_Girl009| AuthorId:Girl RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女只留下一声轻笑，<br>便彻底消失了。|#0204Bad02_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Fearful1

